  "raw_response": "```python\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef solve(grid):\n    if not grid:\n        return []\n    \n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Create a working copy\n    result = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    # BFS from border cells that are 0\n    queue = deque()\n    \n    # Add border cells that are 0\n    # Top and bottom rows\n    for c in range(cols):\n        if result[0][c] == 0:\n            queue.append((0, c))\n            result[0][c] = 3\n        if result[rows-1][c] == 0:\n            queue.append((rows-1, c))\n            result[rows-1][c] = 3\n    \n    # Left and right columns (excluding corners already processed)\n    for r in range(1, rows-1):\n        if result[r][0] == 0:\n            queue.append((r, 0))\n            result[r][0] = 3\n        if result[r][cols-1] == 0:\n            queue.append((r, cols-1))\n            result[r][cols-1] = 3\n    \n    # BFS to mark all outside cells as 3\n    while queue:\n        r, c = queue.popleft()\n        for dr, dc in [(-1, 0), (1, 0), (0, -1), (0, 1)]:\n            nr, nc = r + dr, c + dc\n            if 0 <= nr < rows and 0 <= nc < cols:\n                if result[nr][nc] == 0:\n                    result[nr][nc] = 3\n                    queue.append((nr, nc))\n    \n    # Fill remaining 0s (inside cells) with 2\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if result[r][c] == 0:\n                result[r][c] = 2\n    \n    return result\n```",
  "script": "from collections import deque\n\ndef solve(grid):\n    if not grid:\n        return []\n    \n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Create a working copy\n    result = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    # BFS from border cells that are 0\n    queue = deque()\n    \n    # Add border cells that are 0\n    # Top and bottom rows\n    for c in range(cols):\n        if result[0][c] == 0:\n            queue.append((0, c))\n            result[0][c] = 3\n        if result[rows-1][c] == 0:\n            queue.append((rows-1, c))\n            result[rows-1][c] = 3\n    \n    # Left and right columns (excluding corners already processed)\n    for r in range(1, rows-1):\n        if result[r][0] == 0:\n            queue.append((r, 0))\n            result[r][0] = 3\n        if result[r][cols-1] == 0:\n            queue.append((r, cols-1))\n            result[r][cols-1] = 3\n    \n    # BFS to mark all outside cells as 3\n    while queue:\n        r, c = queue.popleft()\n        for dr, dc in [(-1, 0), (1, 0), (0, -1), (0, 1)]:\n            nr, nc = r + dr, c + dc\n            if 0 <= nr < rows and 0 <= nc < cols:\n                if result[nr][nc] == 0:\n                    result[nr][nc] = 3\n                    queue.append((nr, nc))\n    \n    # Fill remaining 0s (inside cells) with 2\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if result[r][c] == 0:\n                result[r][c] = 2\n    \n    return result",
